WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:33.440 --> 01:37.010
A mint-colored one-piece with
caramel-colored boots.

01:37.480 --> 01:39.750
And we also got a denim jacket.

01:40.320 --> 01:42.450
Next is the accessories store.

01:43.280 --> 01:46.940
A lady's desires are as endless as the sea.

02:16.480 --> 02:18.750
Wow! Who is she?

02:19.320 --> 02:22.220
Since she has the ability to summon
hearts, she's got to be a witch.

02:22.620 --> 02:24.190
That woman is Sarah LaPointe.

02:24.590 --> 02:27.160
A very popular fencer right now.

02:28.100 --> 02:29.120
Fencing?

02:29.460 --> 02:31.000
There are many people like her

02:31.000 --> 02:34.940
who came from the Magical World to the Human World, like myself.

02:35.440 --> 02:38.130
But I'd rather not deal with that sword.

02:39.170 --> 02:40.080
Let's get on with it.

02:42.310 --> 02:44.410
Oh? Fencing, eh?

02:45.110 --> 02:46.150
Chocolat-chan?

02:46.650 --> 02:50.350
I thought only meek girls were
popular in the Human World,

02:50.350 --> 02:54.260
but that strong, gallant woman
took so many hearts!

02:56.260 --> 02:58.730
Aim for the heart! Fencing for love.

03:01.360 --> 03:03.630
Chocolat-chan, there's no way!

03:03.630 --> 03:05.670
If you don't like it, don't come.

03:06.430 --> 03:09.340
I heard that the fencing
team practices here, but...

03:29.790 --> 03:30.960
Chocolat-chan?

03:30.960 --> 03:34.700
Oh, right. Pierre is the
captain of the fencing team.

03:35.500 --> 03:39.370
I've completely forgotten that I was
supposed to take his heart.

03:46.310 --> 03:47.480
This is a perfect chance.

03:47.810 --> 03:49.940
I'll take his heart while I'm at it.

03:54.830 --> 03:57.890
Hey. Did you come to
apologize for the other day?

03:58.350 --> 04:00.720
I had some business here, is all.

04:02.060 --> 04:05.730
Give us special permission to join the
fencing club as elementary school students.

04:05.730 --> 04:08.700
I've already decided on this, so I
won't accept "no" as an answer!

04:09.800 --> 04:10.400
Fine.

04:13.330 --> 04:14.000
It's okay?

04:14.470 --> 04:16.700
You want to join, right? Fine then.

04:17.040 --> 04:18.670
I did it, Vanilla!

04:18.670 --> 04:20.140
Good for you, Chocolat-chan.

04:20.540 --> 04:25.280
However, only if you can take
a point from me in a match.

04:25.750 --> 04:27.550
There's no way I could do that!

04:28.120 --> 04:29.580
You really are weak, aren't you?

04:30.720 --> 04:33.350
But, we've never even fenced before!

04:33.960 --> 04:35.360
Then I'll use a handicap.

04:35.860 --> 04:38.190
I don't mind fighting both of you at once.

04:38.190 --> 04:41.630
And... I'll use my left hand.

04:42.830 --> 04:44.500
Then, we'll do it somehow...

04:44.930 --> 04:46.400
It'll be an easy victory!

04:46.400 --> 04:47.870
Chocolat-chan...

04:48.340 --> 04:50.680
The match will be in one week.

04:51.840 --> 04:53.840
Interesting. We'll do it!

05:02.320 --> 05:04.590
Huh? This is pretty difficult.

05:04.590 --> 05:06.150
That's dangerous!

05:06.150 --> 05:10.330
Besides, if you swing it as half-heartedly as
that, you'll never get any boys' hearts!

05:10.890 --> 05:13.620
It's so disgraceful I can't watch...

05:14.800 --> 05:16.710
Would you like to be shish kabob?

05:16.710 --> 05:19.870
It's dangerous to swing a
sword around violently!

05:20.740 --> 05:22.300
But is this gonna be okay?

05:22.800 --> 05:24.410
We'll do it somehow!

05:24.410 --> 05:27.080
We only have to take one point to win!

05:27.510 --> 05:29.080
We'll definitely win.

05:31.510 --> 05:33.680
Just forfeit.

05:33.680 --> 05:37.990
But there's no way Chocolat-chan
could win against Pierre alone.

05:42.020 --> 05:46.320
What a shame that Vanilla-chama, who never
gets angry, should have to fight like this...

05:46.590 --> 05:48.820
Being that half-hearted ain't gonna work!

05:49.000 --> 05:52.030
Fine, whatever. Won't you come any closer?

05:52.530 --> 05:54.370
If you want me to coach you,

05:54.370 --> 05:56.940
you can either trade that sharp sword for a banana,

05:56.940 --> 05:59.340
or you can deal with me
being over here.

05:59.750 --> 06:03.840
We're not fighting with bananas... And these
swords aren't even sharp, anyway.

06:04.080 --> 06:10.350
Well, if by some chance I did get stabbed,
I'd say it was plenty sharp.

06:10.990 --> 06:12.690
That's a pretty bad phobia he's got.

06:13.020 --> 06:14.850
What a scaredy-cat.

06:15.020 --> 06:17.330
I wish you'd call me "delicate," instead.

06:17.330 --> 06:18.190
Okay, next!

06:18.790 --> 06:20.360
Target practice!

06:23.060 --> 06:24.870
Why am I the target?

06:27.670 --> 06:28.900
Alright!

06:35.490 --> 06:39.110
Oww! That's not fair!
The target can't fight back!

06:40.480 --> 06:45.720
The opponent will fight back in the
real thing, so it's not unfair at all!

06:45.720 --> 06:46.650
Be quiet!

06:47.460 --> 06:49.050
Okay, this time. ..

06:52.830 --> 06:55.280
How impatient, to just charge forward like that.

06:55.280 --> 06:57.430
You can't even remember more than one thing.

07:01.100 --> 07:02.170
Vanilla-chama. ..

07:04.310 --> 07:07.740
Ahh, fencing's kinda hard.

07:08.280 --> 07:09.340
My rhythm's totally off...

07:09.780 --> 07:13.580
It's not too late. Should we call
it off with Pierre?

07:15.950 --> 07:16.820
No way.

07:21.490 --> 07:24.560
You're having a fencing
match with Pierre-sama?!

07:24.890 --> 07:26.560
What's the meaning of this?

07:26.990 --> 07:29.430
The rumors have spread
around the whole school!

07:29.430 --> 07:30.630
Really...

07:31.000 --> 07:32.300
I'll be there to cheer you on.

07:32.730 --> 07:35.470
Plus, I might get to see you lose.

07:35.940 --> 07:38.810
I'm gonna win for sure!
You better be there!

07:38.810 --> 07:40.430
Hey, it's that girl.

07:40.610 --> 07:42.680
Her name is Chocolat Kato.

07:43.040 --> 07:44.510
She looks strong.

07:44.510 --> 07:47.050
Cool, we'll all come watch too.

07:47.580 --> 07:48.650
Chocolat-chan?

07:48.650 --> 07:50.250
While they're paying attention
to the match,

07:50.250 --> 07:53.620
I'll take all the boys' hearts,
just like Sarah LaPointe.

07:53.620 --> 07:55.960
The opportunity came up
really quickly, didn't it?

07:55.960 --> 08:00.290
But no matter how many come to watch, if we
don't look good, we can't collect any hearts.

08:00.290 --> 08:03.230
Speaking of which, can we really
win against Pierre?

08:03.500 --> 08:07.470
Don't worry! I have a feeling we can do this!

08:15.310 --> 08:16.180
Chocolat-chan.

08:17.480 --> 08:18.910
You've got cleaning duty today, right?

08:19.280 --> 08:20.780
I'll head home first.

08:21.220 --> 08:22.480
S-Sure.

08:23.580 --> 08:26.490
That's weird, she's always waited for me.

08:27.260 --> 08:31.480
That's it! Vanilla must've been called out
by a boy so he could confess to her.

08:32.560 --> 08:34.200
I can't lose to her.

08:35.260 --> 08:39.230
I'll put on a good show at the match, and
collect all of their hearts in one shot!

08:47.070 --> 08:48.010
The Members...

08:48.810 --> 08:51.650
Only middle schoolers are allowed
to get close to the prince.

08:52.010 --> 08:54.180
I just want to fence.

08:54.520 --> 08:55.980
It has nothing to do with Pierre.

08:56.420 --> 08:58.490
You called the prince by his first name?!

08:59.020 --> 09:00.180
Rude girl!

09:00.390 --> 09:05.200
If you really want to fence that badly,
we'll be your opponents.

09:07.730 --> 09:10.430
Oh? So that was your plan from the start.

09:10.930 --> 09:11.770
Prepare yourself!

09:14.540 --> 09:16.670
Four-on-one?! Unfair!

09:18.020 --> 09:19.670
Well, if you want to play that way. ..

09:23.380 --> 09:24.810
Sugar Sugar Rune!

09:24.810 --> 09:26.010
Choco Rune!

09:29.980 --> 09:30.430
Wand!

09:39.590 --> 09:40.330
Alright!

09:45.470 --> 09:48.000
Petrify into a frozen stone!

09:55.140 --> 09:57.710
What am I supposed to do when
I'm the one that's frozen?

09:57.710 --> 09:59.410
When did this stone get here?

09:59.410 --> 10:00.310
I don't get it!

10:04.120 --> 10:06.620
Whatever, at least it drove them away.

10:14.200 --> 10:15.260
Pierre...

10:31.950 --> 10:34.420
Don't cheat like that in the actual match.

10:35.180 --> 10:36.020
He saw me?

10:36.650 --> 10:40.320
But how? Humans shouldn't
be able to see magic.

10:44.090 --> 10:46.930
Again, those icy cold hands...

10:48.660 --> 10:49.630
Take your position.

10:52.100 --> 10:52.770
En garde.

10:53.500 --> 10:54.440
This is the basic position.

10:55.100 --> 10:56.070
Step forward.

10:57.640 --> 10:58.610
This is "Marche"

11:00.610 --> 11:01.240
Now step back.

11:03.210 --> 11:03.910
"Rompre."

11:08.450 --> 11:09.650
Extend your right arm.

11:10.080 --> 11:10.520
Thrust.

11:11.090 --> 11:11.620
"Fendez vous."

11:12.020 --> 11:13.400
Yes, very good.

11:13.720 --> 11:16.320
I don't need you to teach me!

11:17.260 --> 11:18.660
No need to thank me.

11:19.360 --> 11:23.460
But if you do happen to win, I'll
give you a kiss as a reward.

11:26.000 --> 11:27.970
If you say that again,
I'll whup your butt!

11:39.610 --> 11:40.350
Vanilla?

11:41.620 --> 11:44.020
You went on home ahead of
me so you could practice?

11:44.020 --> 11:45.450
Chocolat-chan...

11:45.450 --> 11:47.990
Wait just a second,
I'll change really quickly.

11:55.600 --> 11:57.430
Do you want to do this or not?

11:57.430 --> 11:59.700
But it hurts to get poked.

12:00.270 --> 12:04.000
Using magic for something like this
cheapens magic.

12:04.000 --> 12:06.370
You don't even deserve to be called a witch.

12:15.350 --> 12:19.710
But if you happen to win, I'll
give you a kiss as a reward.

12:20.820 --> 12:23.220
Why... Why is that bothering me?

12:23.590 --> 12:25.090
You're blushing.

12:25.090 --> 12:26.720
Light-headed from the bath?

12:26.960 --> 12:28.400
No, that's not it!

12:28.760 --> 12:31.430
Then, have you fallen in love with a human?

12:31.430 --> 12:33.200
L-Love?

12:34.100 --> 12:38.910
The heart is yours to take. But you must
not allow your own to be taken.

12:38.910 --> 12:40.780
That is what we say in the Magical World.

12:41.640 --> 12:47.250
For this crime, of giving your
heart of love to a human...

12:47.250 --> 12:49.740
and of having the jewel of your soul taken, you will be stripped of your appearence,

12:49.740 --> 12:50.750
and banished!

12:50.990 --> 12:54.720
No! I don't like Pierre at all, dammit!

12:54.720 --> 12:55.720
Pierre?

12:57.260 --> 13:00.310
Hey you... Didn't I tell
you not to come in here?

13:04.400 --> 13:05.110
That's it!

13:05.730 --> 13:08.600
I'll get the fortune telling
book to predict the future.

13:10.370 --> 13:11.640
Sugar Sugar Rune!

13:11.640 --> 13:12.910
Choco Rune!

13:18.210 --> 13:19.550
Sugar Sugar Rune!

13:19.550 --> 13:20.510
Choco Rune!

13:21.680 --> 13:23.850
Divination Livre!

13:34.890 --> 13:36.530
Draw out your charm.

13:37.230 --> 13:41.870
The effort to draw out your own charm
is something very important.

13:46.710 --> 13:50.280
I see, so effort really is important.

13:54.550 --> 13:56.320
Not going to bed yet?

13:56.320 --> 13:58.750
Lack of sleep is bad for the skin.

13:59.150 --> 14:02.690
If that happens, your popularity
among the boys will decrease!

14:16.800 --> 14:17.880
I'm done.

14:18.370 --> 14:20.070
What? Finished already?

14:21.180 --> 14:22.740
I don't have much of an appetite.

14:23.440 --> 14:25.180
Can I have your strawberry mousse?

14:25.180 --> 14:27.280
Fine, I'll take it!

14:27.280 --> 14:28.520
Yeah, right!

14:28.520 --> 14:29.820
That's mine!

14:29.820 --> 14:30.910
No way, man!

14:31.190 --> 14:32.320
What did you say?!

14:32.690 --> 14:33.350
Gimme it back!

14:43.830 --> 14:44.530
Vanilla?

14:45.530 --> 14:47.080
Did you hurt yourself?

14:47.080 --> 14:48.670
Did you skin your knee?

14:49.000 --> 14:51.170
No, that's not it.

14:51.970 --> 14:54.240
Vanilla, don't be so hard on yourself.

14:54.840 --> 14:57.280
That's it! Let's have a
practice match together!

14:57.950 --> 14:59.250
With you?

14:59.580 --> 15:03.520
Yeah, then we'll both understand
our own weaknesses.

15:09.690 --> 15:11.530
Don't hold back, come at me!

15:12.130 --> 15:12.760
Okay.

15:26.210 --> 15:29.510
Amazing! Vanilla-chama wins!

15:29.510 --> 15:31.050
That was just a fluke!

15:31.050 --> 15:32.710
There's no way she'd lose to Vanilla!

15:32.710 --> 15:33.820
A loss is a loss.

15:35.320 --> 15:36.520
Chocolat-chan...

15:36.520 --> 15:37.150
Vanilla...

15:38.890 --> 15:41.220
We should just leave her alone for now.

15:51.270 --> 15:53.830
Chocolat-chan, I'm sorry.

15:54.870 --> 15:56.570
You have nothing to apologize for, Vanilla.

15:57.140 --> 15:59.940
Duke was right, it was just a fluke.

16:00.840 --> 16:04.110
Although I kinda wish it
wasn't really a fluke.

16:04.810 --> 16:08.080
Then I wouldn't be holding you back.

16:10.850 --> 16:12.320
It wasn't just any fluke.

16:14.420 --> 16:16.760
Look, see all these blisters?

16:18.520 --> 16:20.170
You were sleeping through class

16:20.170 --> 16:23.200
because you've been staying up all night practicing every day, right?

16:23.500 --> 16:27.430
Every day you'd come home before
me, training really hard.

16:30.100 --> 16:32.340
I'm the one who's holding you back.

16:33.770 --> 16:36.340
I was just thinking about
stupid, pointless things.

16:37.010 --> 16:39.380
I just thought that it'd work out,somehow...

16:40.280 --> 16:42.180
I'm ashamed.

16:43.780 --> 16:44.920
Chocolat-chan...

16:56.000 --> 16:58.000
You're starting to hit more!

16:59.100 --> 17:00.530
Step into it forcefully!

17:01.400 --> 17:02.540
Then, swiftly retreat!

17:03.240 --> 17:04.770
Now, just like that.

17:06.410 --> 17:07.610
Good, faster!

17:07.980 --> 17:09.410
That's too far away.

17:14.720 --> 17:16.760
Chocolat-chan, I'm sorry.

17:17.580 --> 17:22.320
You've practiced too much for my sake,
so I'll do my best for us both!

17:22.960 --> 17:24.790
I wouldn't mind if you quit right now.

17:25.590 --> 17:28.160
If I take one point, I win, right?

17:28.600 --> 17:29.060
Yes.

17:29.660 --> 17:32.870
And I'll use my left hand, just as promised.

17:33.700 --> 17:34.870
I'm gonna do this.

17:39.340 --> 17:41.620
But it should only be for middle schoolers.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.480
Who will be the judge?

17:44.240 --> 17:44.870
I will.

17:47.850 --> 17:48.580
Yurika?

17:50.280 --> 17:52.020
What is this girl planning?

17:52.350 --> 17:53.850
I'll find out for myself.

18:01.560 --> 18:04.910
I might get proof that Kato is an alien.

18:12.170 --> 18:14.150
I ain't holdin' back!
I'm gonna whup your butt!

18:16.280 --> 18:18.380
Kato's really fired up.

18:20.180 --> 18:21.120
En garde.

18:21.920 --> 18:22.350
Pret.

18:30.190 --> 18:30.720
Allez!

18:35.830 --> 18:38.600
Halte. Attaque, touche.

18:39.630 --> 18:40.640
D'oh.

18:48.140 --> 18:50.410
Halte. Attaque, touche.

18:53.710 --> 18:54.350
Halte.

18:57.620 --> 19:00.120
Can't she fire some kind of
alien beam or something?

19:02.860 --> 19:03.960
Giving up already?

19:03.960 --> 19:05.260
Like hell I am!

19:20.410 --> 19:23.080
I don't get it, I haven't even scratched him.

19:23.080 --> 19:25.010
It can't go on like this.

19:26.910 --> 19:28.150
Chocolat-chan...

19:30.550 --> 19:33.650
But I can't lose.

19:34.190 --> 19:37.490
I promised I'd do my best for both of us!

19:48.500 --> 19:50.440
Pull yourself together, Kato!

19:50.440 --> 19:52.010
We're all here for you!

19:52.470 --> 19:54.580
That's right, we're here for you!

19:54.940 --> 19:56.040
You can do it!

19:56.040 --> 19:56.940
Go for it!

20:02.350 --> 20:03.120
En garde.

20:03.780 --> 20:05.550
Pret. Allez!

20:15.060 --> 20:15.900
Set, fine.

20:16.330 --> 20:17.560
The match is over.

20:36.280 --> 20:38.150
Chocolat-chan, look.

20:44.860 --> 20:46.550
Hurry and summon the hearts.

20:49.600 --> 20:50.800
Agrandissment!

20:51.130 --> 20:53.370
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

20:54.100 --> 20:55.400
Your hearts, pick up!

21:14.560 --> 21:16.520
Bravo, Chocolat.

21:18.230 --> 21:19.590
Way too far away...

21:20.930 --> 21:22.200
But why?

21:22.860 --> 21:25.730
I was totally uncool back there.

21:25.730 --> 21:29.100
No, you tried as hard as you
could. You were wonderful.

21:33.510 --> 21:34.270
Pierre...

21:34.610 --> 21:36.440
You fought well by yourself.

21:37.980 --> 21:38.950
Got somethin' to say?

21:40.450 --> 21:44.250
I'll give you that reward I promised
earlier, as a special gift.

21:52.330 --> 21:53.590
A loss is a loss.

21:54.600 --> 21:59.600
If I beat you someday, then it'll
be fine for you to kiss me.

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.170 --> 23:48.860
I wonder what type of person my mother was?

23:48.860 --> 23:52.510
It seems like Duke and Blanca know something... but they won't tell me.

23:52.910 --> 23:55.390
Okay then, I'll just go to the Magical World and do a little research!

23:55.800 --> 24:00.700
Orange moon, pale purple sky, pink clouds, sweet air!

24:01.300 --> 24:03.280
I'm home, my royaume!

24:01.300 --> 24:03.280
Royaume = kingdom

24:03.280 --> 24:06.600
I'm home. The purple city, Ville Violette!

24:07.040 --> 24:09.000
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:09.000 --> 24:11.280
Chocolat is disqualified from the Queen selection test!?

24:11.900 --> 24:14.900
Disqualified... Why?! What does that mean?!
